  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Mo Yao’s will warns Fang Yuan that a true inheritance light is Old Immortal Kong Jue’s item. The test strikes the fated person’s aperture. Fang Yuan asks whether this is the refinement path supreme grandmaster of the Olden Antiquity Era, and Mo Yao agrees. Mo Yao says he had the deepest research in apertures and helped the ten extreme physiques become immortals. Before him, no person of those physiques had risen to immortal. His inheritance there is immortal ascension vital information: his record of immortal ascension across the paths, the difficulties, and the crucial points for rising to immortal.",
      "chapters": [
        598
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_mo_yao",
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "evt_era_olden"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "In a dream realm he appears as an old man.",
      "chapters": [
        724
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Feng Jin Huang travels a dream realm with dream wings Immortal Gu and meets an old man who names himself Kong Jue, mutters, kills people, and dissects corpses. Fairy Bai Qing judges that this is likely Old Immortal Kong Jue, one of the Three Olds. After waking, Feng Jin Huang finds refinement path methods, recipes, and material knowledge clearer in her mind.",
      "chapters": [
        724
      ],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "dream-remnant",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_feng_jin_huang",
        "sys_immortal_gu",
        "char_fairy_bai_qing"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The blessed land relocation method later used from Lang Ya blessed land was created by him, not by Long Hair Ancestor. He named that incomplete immortal killer move the immortal aperture transplantation method. It uses up to sixteen core Immortal Gu and was meant to transplant a Gu Immortal’s immortal aperture into a desolate beast or ancient desolate beast. As left behind, two Gu formations only join the two with great immortal essence cost and only for a short time. His research of apertures and immortal apertures let those of the ten extreme physiques become Gu Immortals and form super grade blessed lands. Long Hair Ancestor obtained this inheritance and failed to complete it.",
      "chapters": [
        901
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "aperture-transplantation",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_lang_ya_blessed_land",
        "char_long_hair_ancestor",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "sys_gu_formation"
      ]
    },
    {
