    },
    {
      "text": "A Gu Immortal coded Blue obtained a Gu Immortal inheritance he left in Central Continent, with deep research into the ten extreme physiques.",
      "chapters": [
        937
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "inheritances-left-behind",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_central_continent"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Blazing Heaven Demoness obtained an inheritance of Immortal Kong Jue in Eastern Sea, learned his method of retrieving apertures, and from it created a fire path immortal killer move that takes an immortal aperture.",
      "chapters": [
        944
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "inheritances-left-behind",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_blazing_heaven_demoness",
        "reg_eastern_sea"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Lang Ya land spirit says the living Long Hair Ancestor used Old Immortal Kong Jue’s true inheritance to break past their limits and conceptualize the immortal killer move immortal tribulation tempering aperture.",
      "chapters": [
        1051
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
